          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "width": "half",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Glow of the Caribbean<strong> </strong>creates stunning, handcrafted jewelry inspired by the vibrant colors, natural beauty, and warm spirit of the islands. Each piece reflects the essence of sunlit shores, turquoise waters, and meaningful moments connected to the Caribbean. Every design carries a story - a feeling, a memory, or a place - captured in jewelry you can wear every day.</p><p>If you’re searching for <strong>Glow of the Caribbean jewelry</strong> or looking to place a <strong>special request</strong>, we’re here to help. While Glow of the Caribbean pieces are not sold directly on our site, we assist customers with special orders, design guidance, and availability.</p><p>Share the styles you love or <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/contact\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/contact\"><em>book a one-on-one appointment</em></a>. Our team will help with customization, details, and ordering your perfect Glow of the Caribbean piece.</p>",
            "button_label": "contact us",
            "button_link": "https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/contact",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "text_alignment": "center"
